<title>PORTUGAL: Argentaria launches 10 bln esc, 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Argentaria launches 10 bln esc, 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead managers Banco Portugues de Investimento, Banco Mello de Investimentos, Banco de Negocios Argentaria.</p>
<p>BORROWER Argentaria Global Finance  AMT 10 billion escudos</p>
<p>    COUPON First coupon 7 percent	 MATURITY 27.2.07</p>
<p>    TYPE Step-up fixed-rate		 ISS PRICE Par</p>
<p>    PAY DATE 27.2.97    RATING Aa3/A+    PAY FREQ Annual</p>
<p>    LISTING London	 GOV LAW UK</p>
<p>NOTES: From the second coupon through to the fifth, interest will be set at the Lisbor three-month rate plus 50 basis points. The sixth to the 10th coupons will be fixed at three-month Lisbor plus 135 basis points.</p>
<p>The new coupons will be set two days before the expiry of the first coupon.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
